SUMMARY:Gulp By Sarah Tonin @ Mad Radio
LOCATION:Mad Radio Miami\, 7700 Biscayne Boulevard\, Miami\, FL 33138\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Born and raised in Buenos Aires\, Gulp is a DJ\, producer\, and
  curator. After residing for 10 years in Berlin\, he built his craft by di
 gging deep into music — sourcing\, mastering\, and blending genres with 
 a collector’s obsession. Residencies\, podcasts\, and features in Reside
 nt Advisor and XLR8R established him as a versatile and restless musical v
 oice. His sets and productions draw from a wide but deliberate palette\, s
 titching together surrealist fragments into something distinctly his own. 
 That same sensibility drives People People\, his cross-genre ensemble that
  keeps pushing genre boundaries. In 2021\, he co-founded The Pressure Comp
 any — a label and platform built around electronic music in all its form
 s\, reflecting the same boundless curiosity that defines everything he doe
 s.\nTags (guess): deep house\, house\nPresented by: Sarah Tonin\nTickets: 
 FREE BEFORE 11PM Free\, ANY TIME ENTRY TIER 1 $20\nhttps://shotgun.live/en
 /events/gulp-by-sarah-tonin-mad-radio
